<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:33:36 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>伊朗称霍尔木兹海峡已被关闭。特朗普政府称每天仍有 900 万桶石油流出</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/iran-strait-of-hormuz-shut-down-trump-9-million-barrels-day/</link><description>“大量非伊朗原油仍在流出，而伊朗原油则不然。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2289371588-e1786718875458.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 16:54:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/iran-strait-of-hormuz-shut-down-trump-9-million-barrels-day/</guid></item><item><title>Anthropic 需要带来亚马逊式的盈利来证明其 2 万亿美元的估值是合理的，但它几乎没有盈利</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/anthropic-valuation-ipo-amazon-trillion-openai/</link><description>投资者希望 10 月份上市时能筹集 2 万亿美元的资金，并能实现尚未公布年度利润的公司所见过的最快的收入增长之一。这对于 OpenAI 来说可能是个好兆头。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2256654494-e1786666405176.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 07:02:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/anthropic-valuation-ipo-amazon-trillion-openai/</guid></item><item><title>“如果你的关税是 0%，就没有必要进行欺诈”：白宫正在大肆宣扬一项 1120 亿美元的关税规避计划，这让情况变得更糟</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/white-house-tariff-dodgers-112-billion-dollar-problem-trump-made-worse/</link><description>特朗普政府正在打击有逃税记录的外国进口商——中国就是其中的中心。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2271127364-e1786735050287.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 19:33:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/white-house-tariff-dodgers-112-billion-dollar-problem-trump-made-worse/</guid></item><item><title>人们竭尽全力阻止自己被梅塔的“变态眼镜”拍摄</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/people-stop-filming-meta-pervert-glasses-privacy/</link><description>方法包括演唱受版权保护的歌曲、下载扫描仪应用程序，但一位律师表示，并非所有这些都是万无一失的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2235448062-e1786735123726.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 19:45:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/people-stop-filming-meta-pervert-glasses-privacy/</guid></item><item><title>Code Metal 获得五角大楼价值 8000 万美元的交易，以实现军事兵棋推演现代化</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/code-metal-lands-80-million-defense-tech-deal-with-pentagon-modernize-military-wargaming/</link><description>随着五角大楼越来越多地转向初创公司进行现代化建设，Code Metal 是一家价值 12.5 亿美元的软件公司，刚刚获得了 8000 万美元的交易。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Code-Metal-Peter-Morales-e1786646790523.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 10:30:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/code-metal-lands-80-million-defense-tech-deal-with-pentagon-modernize-military-wargaming/</guid></item><item><title>路易吉·曼吉奥尼 (Luigi Mangione) 承认杀害联合医疗保健公司 (UnitedHeathcare) 首席执行官的罪名。 “我在曼哈顿枪杀了汤普森先生，他死了”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/luigi-mangione-pleads-guilty-unitedhealthcare/</link><description>这位 28 岁的男子在匆忙安排的听证会上提出抗辩，引发了一场关于他是否仍可因谋杀指控受审的法律斗争。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2276390812.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 17:35:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/luigi-mangione-pleads-guilty-unitedhealthcare/</guid></item><item><title>OpenAI 关于 ChatGPT 企业采用情况的 69 页报告并未解决最大的问题：投资回报率</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/buried-in-openais-latest-research-no-correlation-between-ai-use-and-revenue-per-employee/</link><description>人工智能实验室正在努力解决一个对其未来至关重要的问题：ChatGPT 企业客户能否获得明确的投资回报率？ &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287521321-e1786645857178.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 20:28:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/buried-in-openais-latest-research-no-correlation-between-ai-use-and-revenue-per-employee/</guid></item><item><title>AT&amp;amp;T 的首席营销官将“品牌喜爱度”与首席执行官关心的数字联系在一起。客户离开的可能性降低了 3 倍，获取成本也低得多</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/att-cmo-tied-brand-love-customer-churn-marketing-cmo-revenue-growth/</link><description>AT&amp;amp;T 的首席营销官表示，喜爱该品牌的客户离开的可能性降低了三倍，购买第二种产品的可能性增加了 50%，而且购买成本也更低。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/kellynatt.webp?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 16:15:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/att-cmo-tied-brand-love-customer-churn-marketing-cmo-revenue-growth/</guid></item><item><title>美联航首席执行官斯科特·柯比 (Scott Kirby) 告诉 Z 世代实习生放弃借口——这是他在空军训练中学到的一句口头禅：“弄清楚如何克服它”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/united-ceo-scott-kirby-genz-career-advice-no-excuses-mantra-learned-as-air-force-pilot/</link><description>美国联合航空公司 (United Airlines) 58 岁的首席执行官分享了他在飞行员培训期间学到的第一条箴言，也是最近公开接受检验的一条箴言。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2267710180-e1786719992773.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 15:57:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/united-ceo-scott-kirby-genz-career-advice-no-excuses-mantra-learned-as-air-force-pilot/</guid></item><item><title>来认识一下一位 29 岁的网红，她自称是传统妻子，但实际上她更像是一名自耕农</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/tradwife-homesteading-business-cottagecore-traditional-living-marriage-creator-economy/</link><description>随着创造者将老式技能转变为现代商业，传统生活正在吸引年轻消费者并成为大生意。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gubba-homestead-fortune9.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 15:52:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/tradwife-homesteading-business-cottagecore-traditional-living-marriage-creator-economy/</guid></item></channel></rss>